Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:02.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}What exactly did I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}In the last episode, I told you I saw an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:10.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}Today, let me tell you what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:13.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}You know that we Nigerians love to dress well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:20.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}At weddings, at introductions, at birthdays… every occasion that matters to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:25.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}And wearing matching outfits together is part of our culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:29.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}But I saw that we could still do it much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}How it is designed, how it is made,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:37.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}how it is presented, and how people see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}I wanted to be part of changing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}I wanted to build a fashion house that would give our traditional fashion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.82,0:00:48.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}greater sophistication, proper structure, creativity…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:52.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}and a refined luxury experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.33,0:00:58.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}For the name, I wanted something with real meaning in our culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:02.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}We all know this saying: “E ja se Ankoo.”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:06.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}It means coming together and wearing matching outfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:08.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}It is unity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}It is togetherness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:13.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}It shows who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.23,0:01:17.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}And it shows that we belong to one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.79,0:01:20.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}That is why I named it ANKOO.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:26.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}But my vision went beyond simply making traditional clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:29.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}I wanted to elevate Nigerian traditional fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.81,0:01:34.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}I wanted us to celebrate who we are, with pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:39.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}And to present it the way it deserves, with sophistication and respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.94,0:01:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}I want ANKOO to become a recognised
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:50.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}contemporary African luxury menswear and lifestyle house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.91,0:01:54.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}But seeing a vision is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:58.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(180,180)}Building it… that is another story.
